About this project
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Vectis is a lightweight, reactive agile development process tracking system.
This repository contains the open-source Community edition, released under the
Apache License 2.0. A separately licensed Enterprise edition is maintained out
of tree and is not covered by this license.
